  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a large skillet, melt butter over medium-high heat.",
    "Add chicken and cook until browned, about 5-6 minutes.",
    "Add sliced mushrooms and cook until they release their liquid and start to brown, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "Add diced onion and bell pepper and cook until they start to soften, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "Stir in flour to thicken sauce.",
    "Add cream of chicken soup and stir until combined.",
    "Transfer mixture to a 9x13 inch baking dish.",
    "Top with shredded cheddar cheese.",
    "Bake for 20-25 minutes, or until cheese is melted and bubbly."
